| P24 | Minimum window 1180×720 (DESIGN-V2 §4, tokens.md) | The host keeps `min_inner_size(900, 600)` until C34 because C01-N09 (re-run cumulatively by C24-N06) pins the legacy minimum; the v2 shell is laid out to stay usable without horizontal scroll at 900×600 (rail collapsed to icons below 1280 CSS px) and C28-N07 asserts it at that size. C34 raises the minimum together with the legacy-script retirement | Legacy native acceptance must keep passing while both shells exist (D058 §5) |
